B !...#Hello.#You're here. Good.#Here again.#You came back.                     
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_DONE THEN !You finished [MY_CHAPTER_DONE]. Sit with what
B+ it showed you, before you decide what it meant.                              
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_CHAPTER_STARTED THEN ![MY_CHAPTER_STARTED] is open but          
B+ unfinished. Sometimes that's the most honest place to be.                    
B IFNOTEMPTY MY_ARTIFACT_READY THEN !You've gathered enough shards for          
B+ [MY_ARTIFACT]. Say 'shards' when you want to forge it.                       
